// Previously V3dOcafDoc (handwritten) and VTDocStd_Document (generated) were
// two distinct structs with the same single member. occt2d_ocaf_doc_new()
// returned V3dOcafDoc* while XCAFDoc_DocumentTool::IsXCAFDocument and the
// XCAFDoc_AssemblyGraph ctor dereferenced it as VTDocStd_Document*. That only
// worked because the layouts happened to match. V3dOcafDoc is now a type alias
// of VTDocStd_Document (one type, not two), and the generator no longer emits
