// ===== OCCT OpenGl_View / OpenGl_Window wrappers (handle-holding, obtained from V3d_View) =====
extern "C" void* occt2d_opengl_view_from_v3d_view(void* v3dview)
{
  try
  {
    if (v3dview == nullptr || as_v3d_view(v3dview)->value.IsNull()) return nullptr;
    occ::handle<OpenGl_View> aView = occ::handle<OpenGl_View>::DownCast(as_v3d_view(v3dview)->value->View());
    if (aView.IsNull()) return nullptr;
    return new V2dOpenGlView{ aView };
  }
  catch (...) { return nullptr; }
}
